<BaseLayout title="Car Lockout Entry Hollywood | Daniel's Lock & Key" description="Passenger-vehicle lockout entry in Hollywood. Call Daniel with the location, vehicle details, and proof of authorized access." canonical="/car-lockout/"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow"><p class="kicker">Passenger-vehicle entry only</p><h1>Keys locked inside a car in Hollywood?</h1><p class="lede">Call with the exact location, year, make, model, and proof you are authorized to access the vehicle.</p><div class="actions"><a class="pill" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>Call Daniel · {site.phone}</a><a class="outline" href="/contact/">Request scheduled help</a></div></div></section><section class="section shell service-detail"><div><h2>Before service</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Move to a safe, visible place away from traffic.</li><li>Have identification and registration or other proof of authorization ready.</li><li>Call emergency services first if a child, vulnerable person, or animal is in danger.</li></ul></div><aside><h2>Clear boundary</h2><p>Passenger-vehicle lockout entry only. Daniel does not advertise replacement keys, cutting, programming, transponders, fobs, ignition work, or guaranteed trunk-only access.</p></aside></section></BaseLayout>
